        "details": {
            "description": "<p>In an effort to dispose of the PCs, the szynegation hub reroutes its exhaust systems to pump toxic fumes into this room.</p>",
            "disable": "<p>@Check[athletics|dc:24] to plug the vents with nearby debris, @Check[crafting|dc:22] (trained) or @Check[thievery|dc:22] (trained) on the vent to deactivate the trap, or @Check[computers|dc:24] (trained) to Hack and reverse the flow of exhaust. There are two vents in this room. Once both have been disabled, the toxic fumes clear after 3 rounds. While these fumes persist, PCs need to hold their breath or rely on environmental protections in their armor; otherwise, they risk suffocating on the toxic fumes.</p>",
            "isComplex": true,
            "level": {
                "value": 8
            },
            "publication": {
                "license": "ORC",
                "remaster": true,
                "title": "Starfinder Secrets of the Swarm Adventure Path"
            },
            "reset": "<p>The trap deactivates and resets after 1 minute.</p>",
            "routine": "<p>(1 action) The trap launches exhaust plume strikes against every creature in the room as 1 action. Because it launches exhaust continuously, the trap can also use the Oppressive Exhaust free action (see below) against each creature during that creature's turn.</p>"
        },
